   "title": {
    "en": "Payment mechanisms"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "Payment may be made by cash on delivery, by cheque, by net banking transfer, by credit or debit card, or by digital cash. In India, UPI payments from mobile phones are now very common. Card and bank payments pass through secure payment gateways."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Cash on delivery"
    },
    {
     "en": "Cheque"
    },
    {
     "en": "Net banking transfer"
    },
    {
     "en": "Credit and debit cards"
    },
    {
     "en": "Digital cash"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Payment may be made by cash on delivery, by cheque, by net banking transfer, by credit or debit card, or by digital cash. In India, UPI payments from mobile phones are now very common. Card and bank payments pass through secure payment gateways.",
    "kn": "ಪಾವತಿಯನ್ನು ವಿತರಣೆಯ ವೇಳೆ ನಗದು, ಚೆಕ್, ನೆಟ್ ಬ್ಯಾಂಕಿಂಗ್, ಕ್ರೆಡಿಟ್ ಅಥವಾ ಡೆಬಿಟ್ ಕಾರ್ಡ್, ಅಥವಾ ಡಿಜಿಟಲ್ ನಗದಿನ ಮೂಲಕ ಮಾಡಬಹುದು."
   }
